    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is there a cheaper alternative to the Yoto Mini?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The Voxblock player is £49.99 against £89.99 for the Yoto Mini and £119.99 for the Yoto Player. Yoto cards cost less than our audiobooks: £7.99 against £9.99.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Voxblock a Yoto imitation?",
            "content": "<p>No. Voxblock shares some of the same stories, such as The Gruffalo, but takes a simpler approach. There is no wi-fi, no account and nothing to download: a child picks an audiobook, puts it on the player and presses play. With fewer steps and no settings to manage, children can use it on their own from the start.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Voxblock need wi-fi?",
            "content": "<p>No. There is no wi-fi, no account and no downloads. Each story is stored inside its audiobook: put it on the player and press play.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can my child use wired headphones?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, through the 3.5mm jack. Yoto players have a jack and Bluetooth.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What age is Voxblock for?",
            "content": "<p>From 3 years old, with stories through to unabridged novels for older children.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does the battery last?",
            "content": "<p>Up to 16 hours, charged by USB-C.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I add my own recordings?",
            "content": "<p>Not yet, but it's coming soon. Yoto offers this with Make Your Own cards.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
